---
// The keyboard shortcut, as keys for the visitor's computer. The head script in Base.astro sets
// html[data-os] before first paint; without it (no JS, phones) both versions show.
---
<span class="shortcut"><span class="shortcut__pc"><span class="shortcut__keys"><kbd>Alt</kbd> <kbd>Shift</kbd> <kbd>D</kbd></span></span><span class="shortcut__mac"><span class="shortcut__or"> or, on a Mac, </span><span class="shortcut__keys"><kbd>⌥ Option</kbd> <kbd>⇧ Shift</kbd> <kbd>D</kbd></span></span></span>
